  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nWhen your opponent's monster effect activated
    on the field resolves, if you control a \"GranSolfachord\" monster, you can negate
    that effect, then destroy this card. You can only use this effect of \"Solfachord
    Solfegia\" once per turn.\n\n[ Monster Effect ] \nIf you control no monsters,
    or all monsters you control are \"Solfachord\" monsters: You can Special Summon
    this card from your hand. During your Main Phase: You can activate this effect
    (you can also Tribute this card); Special Summon 1 \"Solfachord\" monster from
    your hand, except \"Solfachord Solfegia\", or, if you Tributed this card when
    you activated this effect, you can Special Summon from your face-up Extra Deck
    or GY instead. You can only use each effect of \"Solfachord Solfegia\" once per
    turn."
